      "message": "Are we planning to support transforming in-place in the future?\n\nIt may help prefixing these with `make` to clarify that we\u0027re not mutating the original object (yes yes, const already does that, but only if one looks at the declaration :).\n\nActually it\u0027s prolly a good idea to tag them with `nodiscard` too.",
